(spectre-crossrange)

# Synthetic TAOS trajectory translation of INBOX/spectre-snippet-v1/simple_aero/crossrange.yaml
# Working set: a banked crossrange steering case

*title Spectre-like crossrange trajectory

*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0

*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1

  *initial geodetic alt=0.0 long=14.4425 lat=35.8766 vel=10.0 gama=0.0 psi=105.0 time=0.0 wt=1000.0

  *file crossrange.dat time alt vel gamgd alpha bankgd thrust
  *segment 1 crossrange
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.1
    *aero ca=0.0 cn=0.0
    *fly bankgd=15.0
    *when time=60 stop

*end
